{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a powerful wizard hidden in the modern world, dueling others across the globe through spoken spells. Defeat your opponents to claim ultimate victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your magical deck with friends or rivals, mastering the five elements\u2014Fire, Water, Darkness, Light, and Spirit\u2014to uncover their hidden synergies. But sometimes, a little luck can turn the tide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win battles to earn Magical Runes and unlock new Spell Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.poster.avif?t=1765363928\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.webm?t=1765363928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.mp4?t=1765363928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience cinematic visuals and spellbinding effects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chant spells into your microphone to unleash powerful abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master five magic systems\u2014Fire, Water, Darkness, Light, and Spirit\u2014and combine cards before battle to create diverse spell schools.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend different schools of magic to unlock deeper strategies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online 1v1 matchmaking battles, or challenge friends to private duels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p